<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1451796544"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1514685226"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Selfish (Alan Walker Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Madison Beer / Alan Walker"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Selfish (Alan Walker Remix)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:57.539"><div begin="00:03.106" end="02:57.559"><p begin="00:03.106" end="00:05.772" itunes:key="L647">Boy, you're such a lost cause<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男孩 你败局已定</span></p><p begin="00:06.202" end="00:08.608" itunes:key="L648">Now your name is crossed off<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今 我将你忘记</span></p><p begin="00:09.186" end="00:11.566" itunes:key="L649">How you gonna fix this?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你如何挽回</span></p><p begin="00:12.195" end="00:15.320" itunes:key="L650">You can't even fix yourself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你甚至无法抚平心伤</span></p><p begin="00:15.330" end="00:17.719" itunes:key="L651">It was almost two years<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">差不多快两年了</span></p><p begin="00:18.183" end="00:20.679" itunes:key="L652">That I chose to spend here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法释怀 虚度光阴</span></p><p begin="00:21.347" end="00:23.762" itunes:key="L653">All alone on New Year's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">新年来临 我孑然一身</span></p><p begin="00:24.296" end="00:28.025" itunes:key="L654">Thinkin', "What the Hell?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心里想着 究竟是怎么了</span></p><p begin="00:28.223" end="00:31.920" itunes:key="L655">I don't wanna break your thread and needle<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想沦落到两败俱伤的地步</span></p><p begin="00:31.930" end="00:39.148" itunes:key="L656">Tryna stitch you, but I can't, I refuse<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试图为你排忧解难 可我做不到 竭力抗拒</span></p><p begin="00:40.649" end="00:43.423" itunes:key="L657">Shouldn't love you, but I couldn't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不该爱你 可我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="00:43.736" end="00:46.479" itunes:key="L658">Had a feeling that you never felt it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心底的痛苦与挣扎 你从未体会</span></p><p begin="00:46.670" end="00:49.495" itunes:key="L659">I always knew that you were too damn selfish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都知道你自私自利</span></p><p begin="00:49.785" end="00:55.227" itunes:key="L660">Don't know why I looked the other way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我不知道为何我总是视而不见</span></p><p begin="00:55.364" end="00:58.728" itunes:key="L661">I wanted you to change, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渴望你改变自己</span></p><p begin="00:58.749" end="01:01.639" itunes:key="L662">I shouldn't love you, but I couldn't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I 我不该爱你 可我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="01:01.801" end="01:04.808" itunes:key="L663">I always knew that you were too damn selfish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都知道你自私自利</span></p><p begin="01:27.607" end="01:30.553" itunes:key="L664">I bet you thought you gave me real love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笃定你以为你全心全意地爱着我</span></p><p begin="01:30.864" end="01:33.569" itunes:key="L665">But we spent it all in nightclubs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我们在夜店里流连忘返</span></p><p begin="01:33.871" end="01:36.642" itunes:key="L666">All you ever wanna do is lie<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你只想撒谎欺骗我</span></p><p begin="01:36.915" end="01:40.034" itunes:key="L667">Why you always such a Gemini?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你像双子座一样有两副面孔</span></p><p begin="01:40.044" end="01:42.636" itunes:key="L668">Baby, who you tryna run from?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 你想逃避什么</span></p><p begin="01:43.344" end="01:45.916" itunes:key="L669">Me or all your problems?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我还是你造成的重重难题</span></p><p begin="01:45.926" end="01:48.752" itunes:key="L670">You know you will never solve 'em<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道自己无能为力</span></p><p begin="01:49.504" end="01:53.181" itunes:key="L671">You don't even know yourself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你甚至连自己都不了解</span></p><p begin="01:53.561" end="01:56.365" itunes:key="L672">Shouldn't love you, but I couldn't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不该爱你 可我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="01:56.629" end="01:59.381" itunes:key="L673">Had a feeling that you never felt it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心底的痛苦与挣扎 你从未体会</span></p><p begin="01:59.532" end="02:02.405" itunes:key="L674">I always knew that you were too damn selfish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都知道你自私自利</span></p><p begin="02:02.669" end="02:07.925" itunes:key="L675">Don't know why I looked the other way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我不知道为何我总是视而不见</span></p><p begin="02:08.364" end="02:11.597" itunes:key="L676">I wanted you to change, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渴望你改变自己</span></p><p begin="02:11.671" end="02:14.552" itunes:key="L677">I shouldn't love you, but I couldn't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I 我不该爱你 可我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="02:14.714" end="02:17.695" itunes:key="L678">I always knew that you were too damn selfish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都知道你自私自利</span></p><p begin="02:28.768" end="02:31.029" itunes:key="L679">But it's not possible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是希望渺茫</span></p><p begin="02:31.244" end="02:34.001" itunes:key="L680">Plus I'm not responsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再说一句 我并非罪魁祸首</span></p><p begin="02:34.231" end="02:37.092" itunes:key="L681">For your self-made obstacles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一意孤行 举步维艰</span></p><p begin="02:37.284" end="02:42.131" itunes:key="L682">Put my heart in the hospital, woah, woah-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我的心遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="02:42.141" end="02:44.944" itunes:key="L683">Shouldn't love you, but I couldn't help it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不该爱你 可我情不自禁</span></p><p begin="02:45.200" end="02:47.954" itunes:key="L684">Had a feeling that you never felt it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心底的痛苦与挣扎 你从未体会</span></p><p begin="02:48.205" end="02:51.025" itunes:key="L685">I always knew that you were too damn selfish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都知道你自私自利</span></p><p begin="02:51.283" end="02:57.559" itunes:key="L686">Don't know why I looked the other way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我不知道为何我总是视而不见</span></p></div></body></tt>